/* .kachat: never pay more than the confirmed price (IOS-054) */
"The price changed to %@ since you confirmed. Nothing was sent. Check the new price and confirm again." = "El precio cambió a %@ desde que confirmaste. No se envió nada. Revisa el nuevo precio y confirma de nuevo.";
